# === Project-level Cargo config (committed: ensures MSVC for Tauri) ===
# The .cargo/config.toml at repo root overrides global ~/.cargo/config.toml
# which may force GNU target. This file IS committed — it is project policy,
# not machine-specific. It guarantees all developers build Tauri with MSVC.
# See: https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/config.html#hierarchical-structure

